# The Kubernetes control plane and node programs the image carries: kube-apiserver,
# kube-controller-manager, kube-scheduler, kubelet and kube-proxy, built from source at the commit
# that tag v1.37.2 of the public repository is. The commit, not the tag, is the pin: build.sh
# fetches that object and fails unless HEAD is it, and a tag can be moved.
#
# Why this release (chosen 2026-11-13, from the repository's tags and its GitHub releases): the
# newest minor whose latest patch release is at least two weeks old. v1.37.2, tag object
# 1755f07c19a1d4a25955616aabdfdd66e0fbe224 at commit c50e5395f1ae2d4a2c05f28fdcc38c0916cc1a32, was
# published 2026-10-28T04:37:53Z, 16 days before that date, and v1.37 has no later patch.
# The repository has no v1.38.0: its newest v1.38 tag is v1.38.0-beta.0, a pre-release, so v1.37
# is the newest minor with a stable release. v1.36.6 (published 2026-10-28) is the newest patch of
# the previous minor.
#
# Moved by: the PM, in a pull request that reruns `make image` and `make image-repro` and the QEMU
# test that starts the control plane, when a patch release of this minor is at least two weeks old
# or an advisory is published for the pinned one. No bot proposes it.
KUBERNETES_REPO=https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes
KUBERNETES_VERSION=v1.37.2
KUBERNETES_COMMIT=c50e5395f1ae2d4a2c05f28fdcc38c0916cc1a32
